I am hungry.
I would like to eat now.
I am standing in the kitchen.
The kitchen is small.
But the stove is good.
I take the parsnip and a carrot.
I like vegetables.
I also take a knife.
The knife is sharp.
I cut the parsnip and the carrot.
I open the tin.
I really like black beans.
I put the food in a pot.
The pot is on the stove.
Now the food is warm.
It smells lovely.
I take the rye bread.
I cut a slice.
The plate is on the table.
Finally, I am eating a proper meal in the flat.
